RED: z-score detector flags anomaly when current rate is 7 sigma above baseline
GREEN: implement ZScoreDetector returning Anomaly when threshold exceeded
REFACTOR: extract DetectionContext dataclass
AUDIT: backend/app/triage/agents/classification_agent.py
