BUG: incidents endpoint returns 500 when an incident has no anomalies
AGENT: scaffold the Executive Summary Agent with Gemini text generation
RAG: build the deterministic embedder for offline tests
DETECT: signature frequency strategy with min absolute floor
EVAL: classification agent accuracy on the database-outage scenario
ULTRA ALT3: prompt-injection defense strategies for the Remediation Agent
PRE: shipping the alert engine without rate limiting
DELPHI: cheapest accurate way to embed runbooks for local execution
```
